# Everything under data/ is tracked: snapshots are the canonical record, and
# data/atlas.json is derived from a *separate* repository that CI does not always
# have, so committing it keeps deploys hermetic.
#
# The published dashboard at ../data/radar.json is tracked too. Jekyll only
# copies files; nothing regenerates it at deploy time.
out/

